  "details": "Currently, the \"Create Group Public Instances\" and \"Create Group+ Instances\" group role permissions do not function in-game unless the \"Create Open Group Instances\" permission is also enabled.\n\nTo recreate this issue, simply create and assign a group role which has either the \"Create Group Public Instances\" or \"Create Group+ Instances\" permission, but not the \"Create Open Group Instances\" permission. The user with this role assigned will not be able to create any type of Group instances.\n\nThis is a problem for groups that want to allow exclusively Groups Public or Groups+ instances to maximize accessibility.",
